  "result": "Perfect! I've successfully implemented the payment processing system for invoicekit. Here's what was added:\n\n## Summary\n\n**New Module: `src/payments.js`**\n- `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })` - Records a payment on an invoice\n  - Validates amount is a positive integer\n  - Only works on `'issued'` or `'partially_paid'` invoices\n  - Returns `OVERPAYMENT` error if payment exceeds balance due\n  - Creates `invoice.payments` array if missing\n  - Updates invoice status to `'paid'` when fully paid, `'partially_paid'` when partial\n  - Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with immutability preserved\n\n- `balanceDue(invoice)` - Calculates remaining amount owed\n  - Returns `total - sum of payments`\n  - Handles missing payments array\n\n**New Error Codes** (in `src/errors.js`):\n- `NOT_ISSUED` - Invoice must be issued or partially paid to record a payment\n- `OVERPAYMENT` - Payment amount exceeds amount still owed\n\n**Test Coverage** (`test/payments.test.js`):\n- 18 new tests covering all payment scenarios:\n  - Recording payments on issued/partially-paid invoices\n  - Status transitions (draft \u2192 rejected, issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid)\n  - Validation (amount type, non-positive amounts, overpayment)\n  - Balance calculations after partial and full payments\n  - Immutability and multiple payment accumulation\n\n**Test Results**: All 159 tests pass (141 original + 18 new)",
